Package: amber-webkit
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, amber-gtk4 (>= 4.16.13), libegl1, bubblewrap, xdg-dbus-proxy
Description: WebKitGTK runtime bundle for the amber suite
 One WebKitGTK build (the GTK 4 API, webkitgtk-6.0) shared by the amber
 applications, built against the amber-gtk4 bundle and installed to
 /usr/lib/amber-webkit. Applications reach it only through their RUNPATH.
 It is deliberately not on the ldconfig path, so installing it cannot
 change what anything else on the system links against.
 .
 It holds the two libraries, the web, network and GPU helper processes,
 the injected bundle and the translations. Media playback, WebAudio,
 WebRTC, gamepads and speech synthesis are not built.
 .
 The sonames are those of the distro's libwebkitgtk-6.0-4, so an
 application built against either set of headers runs on it.

Package: amber-webkit-dev
Section: libdevel
Architecture: amd64
Depends: amber-webkit (= ${binary:Version}), amber-gtk4-dev (>= 4.16.13), libsoup-3.0-dev, libglib2.0-dev
Description: WebKitGTK development files for the amber suite's bundle
 The headers, pkg-config files and unversioned library links of the
 amber-webkit bundle, all under /usr/lib/amber-webkit, so they never
 meet the distro's libwebkitgtk-6.0-dev. The suite's Odin binding is
 generated from these headers.
 .
 Build with PKG_CONFIG_PATH set to
 /usr/lib/amber-webkit/pkgconfig:/usr/lib/amber-gtk4/pkgconfig, and give the
 program the RUNPATH /usr/lib/amber-webkit:/usr/lib/amber-gtk4.
